# mm.shell

Temporary compatibility facade re-exporting mm.shell.posix to preserve existing
consumers while the host shell implementation relocates.

buildable-target no because it re-exports mm.shell.posix, which depends on POSIX
environment APIs unavailable in freestanding targets.
